# TLDR SOC

## Websites

### Malware samples

- Bazar.abuse : Lot of sample of malwares. Possibility to upload your own malware to build the intelligence database
  - https://bazaar.abuse.ch

- Vx Underground : Lots of sample malwares
  - https://vx-underground.org/

  

### IP address

- SPUR : Permit to verify if the IP address is likely a VPS, Proxy, VPN
  - https://spur.us/context/ 
  
- SHODAN : Permit to have lot of informations about an IP 
  - https://www.shodan.io/
  
- GreyNoise : IP reputation based ( For example an IP address who has attempted to exploit a CVE in the past )
  - https://viz.greynoise.io/
  
- Feodo Tracker:  A resource used to track botnet command and control (C2) infrastructure linked with Emotet, Dridex and TrickBot. 
  Additionally, they provide various IP and IOC blocklists and mitigation information to be used to prevent botnet infections.
  - https://feodotracker.abuse.ch/browse/

- Threat Fox:  A resource for sharing indicators of compromise (IOCs) associated to URL or IP.
  - https://threatfox.abuse.ch/browse/
 

### Sandbox 


- TRIA.GE : Online sandbox that permit to analyse the behavior of a process ( Care public report )
  - https://tria.ge/

- ANY.RUN : Online sandbox that permit to analyse the behavior of a process ( Care public report )
  - https://any.run/
 
- Hybrid Analysis : Analyse the behavior of a process / file ( Care public report )
  - https://www.hybrid-analysis.com/

- VirusTotal :Analyse the behavior of a process / file with multiples AV solutions ( Care public report )
  - https://www.virustotal.com/gui/home/upload
  
- Hybrid analysis : Similar to **Hybrid Analysis**
  - https://metadefender.com/
  
- IBM X-Force Exchange : Similar to metadefender 
  - https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/
  

### URL

- URL SCAN : analyzing URL and it gives you a snapshot of the webpage, IP and Domains contacted, ressources requested, technologies used and metadata
  - https://urlscan.io/

- URL Haus:  A resource for sharing malware distribution sites associated to an URL.
  - https://urlhaus.abuse.ch/browse/

- Threat Fox: A resource for sharing indicators of compromise (IOCs) associated to URL or IP.
  - https://threatfox.abuse.ch/browse/
  

### SSL Certificates

-  SSL Blacklist:  A resource for collecting and providing a blocklist for malicious SSL certificates and JA3/JA3s fingerprints.
  - https://sslbl.abuse.ch/ssl-certificates/
  
